            Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
            Unless otherwise agreed in writing, OnnaSoft retains its rights in
            pre-existing software, reusable components, frameworks, libraries,
            methodologies, tools, templates, technical expertise, and other
            materials developed independently of a specific client engagement.
        </p>
        <p>
            Ownership, licensing, and permitted use of custom-developed
            deliverables will be established in the applicable proposal or
            service agreement. Payment conditions, third-party licenses, and any
            agreed intellectual property transfer may affect the rights granted
