            separate agreement or the applicable statement of work.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Third-Party Services and Integrations
        </h2>
        <p>
            Some solutions may rely on third-party platforms, cloud providers,
            APIs, software licenses, hosting services, or external
            infrastructure. These services may be subject to separate terms,
            availability conditions, pricing policies, and privacy practices
