        </p>
        <p>
            Clients are encouraged to review applicable third-party terms,
            licensing requirements, and service limitations before relying on
            external products or platforms for critical business operations.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Service Availability and Maintenance
        </h2>
        <p>
            We make reasonable efforts to maintain the quality, reliability, and
            security of our website and services. However, temporary
